{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3a7d1d7a1abf37cbd903f6633cf486c55127d6cab1dd3e2c17a84c236f482c1f", "ja": "（志保の今回の衣装は、大人っぽくて落ち着いた\nデザインにしてもらった。さて、志保の反応は……）", "zh": "（这次给志保设计的服装，采用了成熟稳重的风格。接下来，就看志保的反应了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c020db0d6ef06c349a79bd048a56c6bafd16a715f344143bd3f9301ac4aac981", "ja": "志保、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "志保，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "472089eed5a11de526695fcb48e0914e559a6446d1aa2d3077cc3830cc755bc0", "ja": "いえ……。{$P$}さん、\nこの衣装……その、大人っぽいですよね？", "zh": "不是……{$P$}先生，\n这套服装……怎么说呢，很有成熟感吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1004_p", "source_sha256": "733967fe701ea0d1547beafe312a264a4148a8870a48783811e3b244ce210586", "ja": "それはもちろん。曲のイメージに合わせて作って\nもらったから、いつもより大人っぽいかもな。", "zh": "那是当然。毕竟是配合歌曲形象定制的服装，可能比平时更成熟一些吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "c01240e51d9316b5e9d17116f432e3db42aef2cdf2a758c1f6f1d656ffa44406", "ja": "そうですよね。私もそう思います。", "zh": "是啊。我也这么觉得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1006_p", "source_sha256": "45e3f8270b072764b42aa02e5901a674abb74e08e7ef398ce2dee4c47fae953d", "ja": "何か、気になるところがあるのか？", "zh": "是有什么在意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "02486e4fc787e9550d6636d7c5625b029dba7aa07da82a4b5f7a423693aee001", "ja": "いえ、問題があるわけじゃないです。\nただ……私自身、大人にはまだまだ程遠いので。", "zh": "没有，并不是有什么问题。\n只是……我自己距离成为大人还差得很远。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "22d73d9444b291baa99b55466e4c08696b30f76a450eda22201d0d760a9788b7", "ja": "だから、こういう衣装になるとは思わなくて。\nちょっと、驚きました。", "zh": "所以，没想到会穿上这样的服装。\n有点惊讶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1009_p", "source_sha256": "95791e35c7b5a48002e03c656aa3576b698bd2a8406f28438a6aabc006d0bd0f", "ja": "そうか。\nもっと自信を持っていいと思うけどな。", "zh": "这样啊。\n我觉得你可以更有自信一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0783e6638c03791868219f892108e4f90bf80f2b93b7c5e40bbc0dd8c2136520", "ja": "子どもだから、大人っぽい衣装を着ちゃいけないなんて\n決まりはないし。", "zh": "又没有小孩子就不能穿\n成熟服装的规定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "81712e8f530b4ce0f1f38b9724cd0906422c857f1e48b8f6357324026fce358d", "ja": "それはそうですけど……。\nなら、お芝居と同じだと思えばいいのかな。", "zh": "话是这么说没错……  \n那就把它当成演戏一样，应该就好了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "0f875e7e619483146965cb428f536ad748c70f0403b919d67ab2495ef1d9ac9d", "ja": "自分より年上の人を演じたり、\n男性を演じることもありますから。", "zh": "我也会扮演比自己年长的人，\n或者扮演男性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1013_p", "source_sha256": "dfed93b7d92f765d632526b768913c6da48f73f4727924c90878d2ca4a51c54d", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。アイドルにしろ、\n演じる役柄にしろ、衣装は強力な武器だと思うんだ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。不管是偶像，还是要饰演的角色，我觉得服装都是强大的武器。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1014_p", "source_sha256": "44c67cbfc865ed93f42d146c5f9bc414c3ceec7e679b48dbb74a51c7484efbc4", "ja": "着た人の魅力を何倍にも高めてくれて、\n光り輝かせてくれるもの。", "zh": "能将穿着者的魅力提升数倍，让其熠熠生辉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "c45ac422b185d5f944b675d41dbf4db059b691ff5e3de819215b69c4382115b0", "ja": "魅力を高める……。", "zh": "提升魅力……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "e11d2a27c5817fc0078f6db4654b3c66c404280839ad7bdaae114a6952f385c9", "ja": "じゃあ、今の私が大人っぽくみえるのも、\nこの衣装のおかげってことですか？", "zh": "那么，现在的我看起来很成熟，也是多亏了这套服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1017_p", "source_sha256": "945f22eeb3ec98f18c4975786172cf5fedddb56a89cba00a65e9b7a6dc41fb4b", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、それは……どうだろうな。\n志保は落ち着いてるから、元から大人っぽくて……。", "zh": "诶！？这、这个嘛……怎么说呢。\n志保本来就很沉稳，看起来就很成熟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "8f94fa6f7602dc5d7e67e6d18962715d95675629fd79734868e9d6ad8afdfb0d", "ja": "そうですか。{$P$}さんが\nどう思っているか、なんとなくわかりました。", "zh": "这样啊。我大概明白了{$P$}先生是怎么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "259dedc09253a57c54f7829fc6f85f2e672b63b099bf09e1d26f93aa0c6941a2", "ja": "別にいいです。大人になろうと思っても、\nすぐになれるわけじゃありませんから。", "zh": "没关系。即使想要成为大人，也不是马上就能做到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "36fd5605c941456c63147298816151b4250783bfa5e667fc6203f97bb01cf4d4", "ja": "私は、私のペースで大人を目指していきます。", "zh": "我会按照自己的步调，朝着成为大人努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7693cb986ea65f8da66ba5626af690c9ac8e25165e83fd0364fa2ef71c347caa", "ja": "志保……。", "zh": "志保……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0684_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "c5508b7fdab4ad8e52f8204eae0bfa956c2768d447a91811753f5c8b77c2c392", "ja": "大丈夫です。いつか絶対、私自身の力で、\n大人っぽいと思わせてみせますから。", "zh": "没事的。总有一天，我一定会靠自己的力量，\n让大家觉得我也很有成熟魅力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
